Operations' two additions are not included. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and calling the metadata service would need `http-client`. Neither is granted, so the world imports neither. Adding them would mean widening the node's `with` clause in the graph.

